{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o021b","title":"刘岱不从鲍信谏而战死","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o021b-account","label":"正文","text":"鲍信劝刘岱暂守待机，刘岱不从，出战黄巾而被杀。","evidence":["wudi-e-o021b-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-864377c756db27a50108","label":"正文","text":"刘岱为黄巾所杀","evidence":["chengguo-q-af6bc8dac7f97c6f572e"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-ffe462acc08d46fd8cd5","label":"裴注·《魏书》","text":"黄巾大众入州界，刘岱欲战，鲍信止之，岱不从遂败","evidence":["cuimao-q-deae771f204885306ffc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0065","role":"劝谏","evidence":["wudi-e-o021b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0060","role":"出战被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o021b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"初平三年","year":192,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o021b-q","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"],"chronology":"wudi-y192","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o019","basis":"初平三年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,162,"O021b"],"order":81}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0060","name":"刘岱","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0065","name":"鲍信","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-af6bc8dac7f97c6f572e","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-0a2e547f2671d6ca6014","layer":"original","quote":"刘岱为黄巾所杀","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7},{"id":"cuimao-q-deae771f204885306ffc","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"会黄巾大众入州界，刘岱欲与战，信止之；岱不从，遂败","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":393,"end":418},{"id":"wudi-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2d83a73c159b7b6cad48","layer":"original","quote":"刘岱欲击之，鲍信谏曰：“今贼众百万，百姓皆震恐，士卒无斗志，不可敌也。观贼众群辈相随〖5〗，军无辎重〖6〗，唯以抄略为资〖7〗。今不若蓄士众之力，先为固守。彼欲战不得，攻又不能；其势必离散。后选精锐，据其要害，击之可破也。”岱不从，遂与战，果为所杀。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":154},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
